//www.nytimes.com/2019/05/01/magazine/king-james-goes-down-how-the-internet-turned-on-lebron.html', 'snippet': 'There’s a distinct glee people find in watching a hero brought low.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On the internet, mockery often follows adoration. For a while, we take pride in the leaders we’ve chosen, forgiving their frailties, basking in their accomplishments, taking their victories as evidence of our own wisdom in exalting them. But do we really want our heroes to believe they’re better than us? Resentment builds quietly. When a hero’s weaknesses start to show, we circle like hyenas, smirking and sneering: He was always a bit arrogant, and she was so overpaid, and did you see his bald spot?', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/05/magazine/05mag-screenland-promo/05mag-screenland-promo-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 699, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/05/magazine/05mag-screenland-promo/05mag-screenland-promo-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 699}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/05/magazine/05mag-screenland-promo/05mag-screenland-promo-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 880, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/05/magazine/05mag-screenland-promo/05mag-screenland-promo-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1759, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/05/magazine/05mag-screenland-promo/05mag-screenland-promo-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType'