ss overwhelming for casual browsers, too.) Here is a guide to some of them.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/03/arts/03friezeoffsite-sculpture1/merlin_154157319_94d1d00b-41be-4370-a8b4-e4c741b18b97-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 411, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/03/arts/03friezeoffsite-sculpture1/merlin_154157319_94d1d00b-41be-4370-a8b4-e4c741b18b97-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 411}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/03/arts/03friezeoffsite-sculpture1/merlin_154157319_94d1d00b-41be-4370-a8b4-e4c741b18b97-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 702, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/03/arts/03friezeoffsite-sculpture1/merlin_154157319_94d1d00b-41be-4370-a8b4-e4c741b18b97-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1404, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/03/arts/03friezeoffsite-sculpture1/02friezeoffsite-sculpture1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/05/03/arts/03friezeoffsite-sculpture1/02friezeoffsite-sculpture1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/03/arts/03friezeoffsite-sculpture1/02friezeoffsite-sculpture1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main