bf-a8e3-445552bfe75f', 'word_count': 100, 'uri': 'nyt://article/980a3cc1-2ce8-5fbf-a8e3-445552bfe75f'}, {'abstract': 'Therapy might be the best bet.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/02/style/boyfriend-workaholic-therapy.html', 'snippet': 'Therapy might be the best bet.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’ve been with my boyfriend for a year. Occasionally, he goes into deep panics about his work and cancels plans — and not just with me. He cancels dinners with friends and important doctors’ appointments, holidays with his family and trips we’ve booked months in advance. I love him, and want to be compassionate about his panic and his work. But some plans are important to me. We’re supposed to visit my family soon, and he’s already threatening to cancel. He says: Everything will fall apart if he goes away. What can I do?', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 599, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 599}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 923, 'width': 925, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 923, 'width': 925, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 