stract': 'Recognized as the first woman to become a full-time photographer on a British national newspaper, she earned her male colleagues’ respect “just by getting on with my job.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/02/obituaries/doreen-spooner-dead.html', 'snippet': 'Recognized as the first woman to become a full-time photographer on a British national newspaper, she earned her male colleagues’ respect “just by getting on with my job.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Doreen Spooner was already well known on Fleet Street, recognized as the first woman to become a full-time staff photographer for a British national newspaper. Then came the picture of two saucy showgirls that she snapped surreptitiously from the ladies’ loo in a London pub in 1963. It landed on front pages around the world.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/03/obituaries/02Spooner1/merlin_154182897_9499ecd7-9af6-4f69-bc41-699316aae6e0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 581, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/03/obituaries/02Spooner1/merlin_154182897_9499ecd7-9af6-4f69-bc41-699316aae6e0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 581}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/03/obituaries/02Spooner1/merlin_154182897_9499ecd7-9af6-4f69-bc41-699316aae6e0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 992, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/03/obituaries/02Spooner1/merlin_154182897_9499ecd7-9af6-4f69-bc41-699316aae6e0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1985, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit