stract': 'To survive, I had to separate from my schizophrenic mother and her vision of the world as a hostile place. Years later I came to understand her.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/03/well/family/finding-a-way-back-to-a-flawed-and-dangerous-mother.html', 'snippet': 'To survive, I had to separate from my schizophrenic mother and her vision of the world as a hostile place. Years later I came to understand her.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When she was in her 30s, my mother, Madeleine Weidlinger, started seeing double and had intense disabling headaches. Gradually her eyes appeared to recede into her skull. She consulted a wide range of specialists, none of whom could find anything wrong.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/03/well/03ties-mother/merlin_154232070_ebb6d661-1808-49ce-a026-630a86f223ae-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/03/well/03ties-mother/merlin_154232070_ebb6d661-1808-49ce-a026-630a86f223ae-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/03/well/03ties-mother/merlin_154232070_ebb6d661-1808-49ce-a026-630a86f223ae-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/03/well/03ties-mother/merlin_154232070_ebb6d661-1808-49ce-a026-630a86f223ae-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/03/well/03ties-mother/03ties-mother-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thum