, 'word_count': 870, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e97db912-d6c8-5436-9762-a744fd718e31'}, {'abstract': 'Bruce Heyman, President Barack Obama’s ambassador to Canada, is back in Chicago where he has become a leading voice for Canada in the United States.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/03/world/canada/us-ambassador-bruce-heyman-vicki-heyman.html', 'snippet': 'Bruce Heyman, President Barack Obama’s ambassador to Canada, is back in Chicago where he has become a leading voice for Canada in the United States.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bruce and Vicki Heyman returned to Ottawa this week for the launch of their new book, “The Art of Diplomacy.” A former senior Goldman Sachs executive from Chicago, Bruce Heyman was President Barack Obama’s ambassador to Canada from 2014 to 2017.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/02/world/00canada-letter1/merlin_154285134_9dfd53ef-2167-4aa5-ac16-dc23e6392c47-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 451, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/02/world/00canada-letter1/merlin_154285134_9dfd53ef-2167-4aa5-ac16-dc23e6392c47-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 451}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/02/world/00canada-letter1/merlin_154285134_9dfd53ef-2167-4aa5-ac16-dc23e6392c47-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 770, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/02/world/00canada-letter1/merlin_154285134_9dfd53ef-2167-4aa5-ac16-dc23e6392c47-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1540, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/02/worl