 how the A.N.C. and other parties are financing their campaigns. A new law won’t help.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/04/world/africa/south-africa-election-campaign-ramaphosa.html', 'snippet': 'With a pivotal general election this week, South Africans know little about how the A.N.C. and other parties are financing their campaigns. A new law won’t help.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JOHANNESBURG — The “war room” for the African National Congress candidates running in local elections three years ago was an elaborate operation with new computers, wall monitors, lodging for volunteers and catered food three times a day.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/18/world/xxSAFRICA-CAMPAIGN-FINANCE-sub1/merlin_153691722_6db8be9c-6f54-4990-9833-01dfe053ff25-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/18/world/xxSAFRICA-CAMPAIGN-FINANCE-sub1/merlin_153691722_6db8be9c-6f54-4990-9833-01dfe053ff25-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/18/world/xxSAFRICA-CAMPAIGN-FINANCE-sub1/merlin_153691722_6db8be9c-6f54-4990-9833-01dfe053ff25-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/18/world/xxSAFRICA-CAMPAIGN-FINANCE-sub1/merlin_153691722_6db8be9c-6f54-4990-9833-01dfe053ff25-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/18/world/xxSAFRICA-CAMPAIGN-FINANCE-sub1/xxSAFRICA-CAMPAI