 plants and arrangements. We tracked their installation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/05/arts/rockefeller-gardens.html', 'snippet': 'Inspired by its 19th-century history, the Channel Gardens has been reimagined and filled with native plants and arrangements. We tracked their installation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Rockefeller Center isn’t just a place, it’s also a symbol. The iconic Art Deco complex of office buildings, shops and restaurants in Midtown Manhattan — home to Radio City Music Hall, a selfie-attracting skating rink, sculptures of Atlas and Prometheus and, every holiday season, a towering Christmas tree — epitomizes both New York’s muscular 20th-century past and its tourist-friendly present. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/06/arts/01rockefeller-gardens1/01rockefeller-gardens1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 421, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/06/arts/01rockefeller-gardens1/01rockefeller-gardens1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 421}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/06/arts/01rockefeller-gardens1/01rockefeller-gardens1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 719, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/06/arts/01rockefeller-gardens1/01rockefeller-gardens1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1437, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/06/arts/01rockefeller-gardens1/01rockefeller-gardens1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'cr