', '_id': 'nyt://article/174865e5-8dfb-5e94-8361-d1615caa0c3e', 'word_count': 843, 'uri': 'nyt://article/174865e5-8dfb-5e94-8361-d1615caa0c3e'}, {'abstract': 'As more people travel abroad, travelers and doctors need to be alert to unusual and often perplexing skin infections.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/06/well/live/when-travelers-bring-skin-infections-back-as-souvenirs.html', 'snippet': 'As more people travel abroad, travelers and doctors need to be alert to unusual and often perplexing skin infections.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A 5-year-old girl was brought to the emergency room at Evelina London Children’s Hospital with itchy, rather unsightly sores on both legs. She had recently returned from a weekslong trip to Sierra Leone, and the lesions, which first appeared three weeks into her stay there, had become larger and ulcerated.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/07/science/07BRODYTRAVEL/bd8ec4b6db204350b673b135f769031c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/07/science/07BRODYTRAVEL/bd8ec4b6db204350b673b135f769031c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/07/science/07BRODYTRAVEL/bd8ec4b6db204350b673b135f769031c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 678, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/07/science/07BRODYTRAVEL/bd8ec4b6db204350b673b135f769031c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1302, 'width': 1965, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'ur