 end up devoted companions for 35 years. But first, Capote needed to win him over. So he hatched a plan: they would head to Italy.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/12/travel/07Mediterranean-Capote6/oakImage-1556726921264-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 581, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/12/travel/07Mediterranean-Capote6/oakImage-1556726921264-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 581}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/12/travel/07Mediterranean-Capote6/oakImage-1556726921264-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 992, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/12/travel/07Mediterranean-Capote6/oakImage-1556726921264-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1983, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/12/travel/07Mediterranean-Capote6/07Mediterranean-Capote6-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/05/12/travel/07Mediterranean-Capote6/07Mediterranean-Capote6-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/12/travel/07Mediterranean-Capote6/07Mediterranean-Capote6-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Retracing Truman Capote’s Moment in the Mediterranean Sun', 'kicker': 'footsteps'