ing $1.17 billion in business losses. Here’s what else the numbers show.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/07/us/trump-tax-figures.html', 'snippet': 'The Times obtained details from a decade of the president’s tax returns, revealing $1.17 billion in business losses. Here’s what else the numbers show.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Since the 2016 presidential campaign, journalists at The New York Times and elsewhere have been trying to piece together Donald J. Trump’s complex and concealed finances. Now The Times has obtained 10 years of previously unrevealed figures from the president’s federal income tax returns. The tax numbers, for the years 1985 through 1994, paint a far bleaker picture of Mr. Trump’s deal-making abilities and financial condition than the one he has long put forth.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/05/multimedia/05tax-takeaways/merlin_108434002_f82a67f8-b8e6-4c62-a7c8-c92b0c083b8d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/05/multimedia/05tax-takeaways/merlin_108434002_f82a67f8-b8e6-4c62-a7c8-c92b0c083b8d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/05/multimedia/05tax-takeaways/merlin_108434002_f82a67f8-b8e6-4c62-a7c8-c92b0c083b8d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/05/multimedia/05tax-takeaways/merlin_108434002_f82a67f8-b8e6-4c62-a7c8-c92b0c083b8d-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image'