n Danger.” Parts of it are reproduced verbatim (in English), in Abel Ferrara’s new film.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/09/arts/09pasolinipix/merlin_154382988_219f7cae-a8f6-4b17-815d-07bb3efea932-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 346, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/09/arts/09pasolinipix/merlin_154382988_219f7cae-a8f6-4b17-815d-07bb3efea932-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 346}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/09/arts/09pasolinipix/merlin_154382988_219f7cae-a8f6-4b17-815d-07bb3efea932-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 591, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/09/arts/09pasolinipix/merlin_154382988_219f7cae-a8f6-4b17-815d-07bb3efea932-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1182, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/09/arts/09pasolinipix/merlin_154382988_219f7cae-a8f6-4b17-815d-07bb3efea932-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/05/09/arts/09pasolinipix/merlin_154382988_219f7cae-a8f6-4b17-815d-07bb3efea932-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/09/arts/09pasolinipix/merlin_154382988_219f7cae-a8f6-4b17-815d-07bb3efea932-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'ma