constitutional-crisis.html', 'snippet': 'House Speaker Nancy Pelosi said Thursday that the nation is in a “constitutional crisis,” with the executive branch of government broadly refusing to cooperate with the legislative branch.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Speaker Nancy Pelosi said Thursday that the United States was in a “constitutional crisis” and warned that House Democrats might move to hold more Trump administration officials in contempt of Congress if they continued their refusals to comply with committee subpoenas.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pelosi Declares Nation Is in a ‘Constitutional Crisis’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Constitution (US)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Special Prosecutors (Independent Counsel)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pelosi, Nancy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-05-09T14:48:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sheryl Gay Stolberg and Nicholas Fandos', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sheryl', 'middlename': 'Gay', 'lastname': 'Stolberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fandos', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5eccf4da-a1f3-525d-9067-6c3e3bf7d1da', 'word_count': 660, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5eccf4da-a1f3-525d-9067-6c3e3bf7d1da'}, {'abstract': 'Yes, I’ve lost a lot of weight. No, I don’t want to hear even the nicest comments about it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/09/style/please-stop-talking-about-my-body.html', 'snippet': 'Yes, I’ve lost a lot of weight. No, I don’t want to hear even the nicest comments about it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’ve been through three big weight gains and losses in my life (about 50 pounds each time). Whenever I lose weight, I get tons of comments: “You look so great!” “I hardly recognized you!” I hate these remarks. I’d like to respond: “Thank God I’m not so fat and ugly and gross anymore, right?” Or: “My body is none of your business.” I’m losing weight again now, so I’m getting barraged with comments. So far, I’ve just been saying thanks. But I’d love to express how uncomfortable these remarks make me without offending anyone. Thoughts?', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 599, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 599}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 923, 'width': 925, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 923, 'width': 925, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'th