news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/6730a16a-fffd-5f91-b3ed-84a888e36cd8', 'word_count': 759, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6730a16a-fffd-5f91-b3ed-84a888e36cd8'}, {'abstract': 'The president seems eager to force the hand of Democrats who are investigating him as if they were conducting an impeachment inquiry without actually calling it that.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/09/us/politics/trump-democrats-impeachment.html', 'snippet': 'The president seems eager to force the hand of Democrats who are investigating him as if they were conducting an impeachment inquiry without actually calling it that.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — As the White House and Congress escalate their constitutional showdown, President Trump and his team are essentially trying to call what they see as the Democrats’ bluff. The message: Put up or shut up. Impeach or move on.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/09/us/politics/09dc-privilege1/merlin_154583241_35e85697-c6fa-4a48-8474-e1a24e379bbe-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 543, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/09/us/politics/09dc-privilege1/merlin_154583241_35e85697-c6fa-4a48-8474-e1a24e379bbe-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 543}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/09/us/politics/09dc-privilege1/merlin_154583241_35e85697-c6fa-4a48-8474-e1a24e379bbe-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 927, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/20