ntle of motherhood back up.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/10/well/family/from-a-free-spirit-to-a-wise-elder.html', 'snippet': 'My hippie mother did not interfere when I left home as a teen to seek enlightenment. But she has picked the mantle of motherhood back up.', 'lead_paragraph': '“You seem to think I have relinquished my role as your mother,” my mother wrote to me when I was 15 and living with another family in Staten Island. It was just across the river from where I had been born in Brooklyn, but 2,000 miles away from where my family had settled in the mountains of northern New Mexico.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/10/science/10TIESFREESPIRIT/3def0b6d73c4476f9abf7b6f95aa983d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/10/science/10TIESFREESPIRIT/3def0b6d73c4476f9abf7b6f95aa983d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/10/science/10TIESFREESPIRIT/3def0b6d73c4476f9abf7b6f95aa983d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/10/science/10TIESFREESPIRIT/3def0b6d73c4476f9abf7b6f95aa983d-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/10/science/10TIESFREESPIRIT/10TIESFREESPIRIT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/05/10/science/10TIESFREESPIRIT/10TIESFREESPIRIT-thumbStandard.jpg', 