 in the park, her grandchildren running before her. Maybe it means waiting for someone you made to pad into your bedroom to serve you a heap of scrambled eggs and a few pieces of toast, along with a strawberry and a crayon-inked card. I kind of hope it is all those things, but mostly that someone will, at some point in the day, cook for a mom.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/21/dining/ar-eggs-benedict/ar-eggs-benedict-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 422, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/21/dining/ar-eggs-benedict/ar-eggs-benedict-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 422}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/21/dining/ar-eggs-benedict/ar-eggs-benedict-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 721, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/21/dining/ar-eggs-benedict/ar-eggs-benedict-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1441, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/21/dining/ar-eggs-benedict/ar-eggs-benedict-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/21/dining/ar-eggs-benedict/ar-eggs-benedict-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/21/dining/ar-eggs-benedict/ar-eggs-benedict-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Wh