nyt://article/b9235d88-bda3-5de0-a8d8-89a1cb99dec9'}, {'abstract': 'Two requests by presidential advisers show how far the White House has gone to try to push back on accusations that the president obstructed justice.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/10/us/politics/mcgahn-trump-obstruction.html', 'snippet': 'Two requests by presidential advisers show how far the White House has gone to try to push back on accusations that the president obstructed justice.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — White House officials asked at least twice in the past month for the key witness against President Trump in the Mueller report, Donald F. McGahn II, to say publicly that he never believed the president obstructed justice, according to two people briefed on the requests.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/10/us/politics/10dc-obstruct/merlin_154626138_884b1f6d-94ed-4e42-9db0-d44eed0d8bd3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/10/us/politics/10dc-obstruct/merlin_154626138_884b1f6d-94ed-4e42-9db0-d44eed0d8bd3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/10/us/politics/10dc-obstruct/merlin_154626138_884b1f6d-94ed-4e42-9db0-d44eed0d8bd3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/10/us/politics/10dc-obstruct/merlin_154626138_884b1f6d-94ed-4e42-9db0-d44eed0d8bd3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None,