rstand my own mind.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/11/opinion/sunday/motherhood-pregnancy.html', 'snippet': 'The women in my family became mothers early. It took me longer to understand my own mind.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The phone call on a Friday brought me to my feet. At the window of my high-rise apartment I watched people swarming the sidewalks, taking advantage of the spring weather. “It’s not as bad as it sounds,” my doctor said. I paced my living room as she described the procedure she thought could treat my fibroids. “We’re still trying to find out why black women get this at such alarming rates. There’s still no data on that,” she said.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/12/opinion/sunday/12dennisbenn/merlin_154676826_00f0ac0c-8548-4b5d-9e14-488547b137bd-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 780, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/12/opinion/sunday/12dennisbenn/merlin_154676826_00f0ac0c-8548-4b5d-9e14-488547b137bd-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 780}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/12/opinion/sunday/12dennisbenn/merlin_154676826_00f0ac0c-8548-4b5d-9e14-488547b137bd-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 789, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/12/opinion/sunday/12dennisbenn/merlin_154676826_00f0ac0c-8548-4b5d-9e14-488547b137bd-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1577, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/12/opinion/sunday/12dennisbenn/12dennisbenn-thumbStandard.jp