gs-safety.html', 'snippet': 'The fake quality-control data, bird infestations and toxic impurities at the overseas plants that could be making your medication.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the fall of 2012, a young consumer safety officer at the Food and Drug Administration volunteered for a job that few of his colleagues wanted: inspecting the Indian manufacturing plants that make many of America’s low-cost generic drugs.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/12/opinion/sunday/12eban/merlin_154668396_c18ab89c-53b9-4b02-9414-c6e42cbeeb35-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 386, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/12/opinion/sunday/12eban/merlin_154668396_c18ab89c-53b9-4b02-9414-c6e42cbeeb35-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 386}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/12/opinion/sunday/12eban/merlin_154668396_c18ab89c-53b9-4b02-9414-c6e42cbeeb35-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 659, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/12/opinion/sunday/12eban/merlin_154668396_c18ab89c-53b9-4b02-9414-c6e42cbeeb35-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1318, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/12/opinion/sunday/12eban/12eban-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/05/12/opinion/sunday/12eban/12eban-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'cre