2ed'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Huffman, the Hollywood actor, was charged with conspiracy in the college admissions fraud scandal; her husband, the actor William H. Macy, was not charged.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/13/us/felicity-huffman-guilty-college-admissions-scandal.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Huffman, the Hollywood actor, was charged with conspiracy in the college admissions fraud scandal; her husband, the actor William H. Macy, was not charged.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BOSTON — The actress Felicity Huffman stood facing the judge, looking somber and subdued, in a gray dress and gray sweater. She wanted to make a few things clear, she said. Her daughter was not involved in the scheme to cheat on the SAT. And neither was a neuropsychologist who had treated her daughter since she was 8 years old. The responsibility, Ms. Huffman seemed to say, should only fall on her.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/13/us/13HUFFMAN2-hp-promo/merlin_154794267_4652fd28-aa07-4b5b-9f89-02d07a90f807-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/13/us/13HUFFMAN2-hp-promo/merlin_154794267_4652fd28-aa07-4b5b-9f89-02d07a90f807-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/13/us/13HUFFMAN2-hp-promo/merlin_154794267_4652fd28-aa07-4b5b-9f89-02d07a90f807-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/13/us/13HUFFMAN2-hp-promo/merlin_154794267_4652fd28-aa07-4b5b-9f89-02d07a90f807-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 