lm actress since Shirley Temple.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/13/obituaries/doris-day-death.html', 'snippet': 'From the perky girl next door in the 1950s to the woman next door in 1960s sex comedies, Ms. Day was the most popular film actress since Shirley Temple.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Doris Day, the freckle-faced movie actress whose irrepressible personality and golden voice made her America’s top box-office star in the early 1960s, died on Monday at her home in Carmel Valley, Calif. She was 97.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Doris Day, Movie Star Who Charmed America, Dies at 97', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Doris Day, America’s Movie Star Next Door, Dies at 97', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Day, Doris', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ACTORS AND ACTRESSES', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Animal Abuse, Rights and Welfare', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-05-13T13:47:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Obits', 'section_name': 'Obituaries', 'byline': {'original': 'By Aljean Harmetz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Aljean', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Harmetz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/ce2a3479-a409-54ee-bd47-aa811d6489ea', 'word_count': 2550, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ce2a3479-a409-54ee-bd47-aa811d6489ea'}, {'abstract': 'Ben S. Bernanke, Timothy F. Geithner, Jacob J. Lew and Janet L. Yellen said the Trump administration’s push to relax some controls could harm the American financial system’s stability.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/13/us/politics/financial-regulation-trump-administration.html', 'snippet': 'Ben S. Bernanke, Timothy F. Geithner, Jacob J. Lew and Janet L. Yellen said the Trump administration’s push to relax some controls could harm the American financial system’s stability.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two former Treasury secretaries joined two former Federal Reserve leaders on Monday to warn that the Trump administration’s efforts to relax oversight of certain financial firms could seriously threaten the stability of America’s financial system.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/14/business/13DC-REGULATION/13DC-REGULATION-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/14/business/13DC-REGULATION/13DC-REGULATION-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/14/business/13DC-REGULATION/13DC-REGULATION-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/14/business/13DC-REGULATION/13DC-REGULATION-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/14/business/13DC-REGULATION/13DC-REGULATION-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/05/14/business/13DC-REGULATION/13DC-REGULATION-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnai