ial': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e7662591-f4cd-5042-a645-12067dc9dd55', 'word_count': 1643, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e7662591-f4cd-5042-a645-12067dc9dd55'}, {'abstract': 'The magazine’s Ethicist columnist on inoculating a sibling’s children behind her back, and more.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/14/magazine/can-i-get-my-anti-vaxx-sisters-kids-vaccinated.html', 'snippet': 'The magazine’s Ethicist columnist on inoculating a sibling’s children behind her back, and more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I am the primary caregiver for my elderly mother, who has lupus and thus a compromised immune system. My sister has four young children, none of whom she has had vaccinated out of fear that vaccines cause autism. ', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/10/07/magazine/19mag-ethicist-image1/19mag-ethicist-image1-articleLarge-v21.jpg', 'height': 318, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/10/07/magazine/19mag-ethicist-image1/19mag-ethicist-image1-articleLarge-v21.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 318}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/10/07/magazine/19mag-ethicist-image1/19mag-ethicist-image1-jumbo-v21.jpg', 'height': 543, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/10/07/magazine/19mag-ethicist-image1/19mag-ethicist-image1-superJumbo-v21.jpg', 'height': 1085, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/10/07/magazine/19mag-ethicist-image1/19mag-ethicist-image1-thumbStandard-v22.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 