': 'The author of “Salt Fat Acid Heat” and star of the related Netflix show chooses the dishes that define the cuisine for her.', 'lead_paragraph': '“You may attend school in America,” my mom regularly told me and my brothers when we were kids in our native San Diego, in the 1980s, “but when you come home, you’re in Iran.” Accordingly, we spoke Farsi, and attended Persian school on Saturdays to learn to read and write the language; we listened to classical Persian setar music; and celebrated Nowruz, the Persian New Year.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/15/dining/14Iranian6-promo/merlin_154113903_5b2b32c0-3c7b-45bd-9465-e300b8ea687f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/15/dining/14Iranian6-promo/merlin_154113903_5b2b32c0-3c7b-45bd-9465-e300b8ea687f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/15/dining/14Iranian6-promo/merlin_154113903_5b2b32c0-3c7b-45bd-9465-e300b8ea687f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/15/dining/14Iranian6-promo/merlin_154113903_5b2b32c0-3c7b-45bd-9465-e300b8ea687f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/15/dining/14Iranian6-promo/14Iranian6-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/05/15/dining/14Iranian6-promo/14Iranian6-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/15/dining/14Iranian6-promo/14Iranian6-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Samin Nosrat’s 10 Essential Persian Recipes', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Persian Essentials', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Iranian-Americans', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Herbs', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Salads', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Lamb', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Yogurt', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pomegranates', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nosrat, Samin', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recipes', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-05-14T18:59:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8d46551b-3b24-5ad9-a0b6-7169fdb3fff8', 'word_count': 2079, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8d46551b-3b24-5ad9-a0b6-7169fdb3fff8'}, {'abstract': 'Modern Love in miniature, college-contest edition, featuring the best student love stories of no more than 100 words.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/14/style/tiny-love-stories-was-he-fixated-on-race.html', 'snippet': 'Modern Love in miniature, college-contest edition, featuring the best student love stories of no more than 100 words.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The things I was too scared to say to him in person, I would talk about on my podcast. I knew he’d be listening. My medication? Yes. Sexual history? Sure. Fears? I’d pepper these throughout the episodes. “It’s funny,” he’d say. “I’m learning so much about you. All I have to do is listen to your podcast.” With my lips to the microphone and his earphones at the ready, I thought I was saving us from having to discuss the awkward topics face-to-face, but without that vulnerability, we never stood a chance. Like every episode, the end was inevitable. — Louis Hanson, University of Sydney, Australia', 'print_section': 'P', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/22/fashion/xxtinylove-maypromo5/xxtinylove-maypromo5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/04/22/fashion/xxtinylove-maypromo5/xxtinylove-maypromo5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/22/fashion/xxtinylove-maypromo5/xxtinylove-maypromo5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/22/fashion/xxtinylove-maypromo5/xxtinylove-maypromo5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2045, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/04/22/fashion/xxtinylove-maypromo5/xxtinylove-maypromo5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/04/22/fashion/xxtinylove-maypromo5/xxtinylove-maypromo5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption