The president has tagged Joe Biden with two nicknames and argued that he’s naïve about threats to America. But he’s also likened Mr. Biden’s bid to his own successful campaign.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/14/us/politics/trump-biden-2020.html', 'snippet': 'The president has tagged Joe Biden with two nicknames and argued that he’s naïve about threats to America. But he’s also likened Mr. Biden’s bid to his own successful campaign.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — As President Trump has struggled to explain the difficulty of negotiating a trade agreement with China, he has embraced a side argument: A Democratic president would only agree to a worse deal.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/14/us/politics/14trump-biden1/14trump-biden1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/14/us/politics/14trump-biden1/14trump-biden1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/14/us/politics/14trump-biden1/14trump-biden1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/14/us/politics/14trump-biden1/14trump-biden1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/14/us/politics/14trump-biden1/14trump-biden1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/05/14/us/politics/14trump-