cle/c96d5990-21b1-5576-a94a-a23b168a17ba'}, {'abstract': 'Power is rhetoric, and the ability to convince others they ought to do what you want them to do.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/16/opinion/propaganda-is-power.html', 'snippet': 'Power is rhetoric, and the ability to convince others they ought to do what you want them to do.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Over the past few years, far-right nationalist political leaders around the world have been using harsh rhetoric against minority groups, particularly immigrants. We know from history that acts of genocide, ethnic cleansing and terrorism have been preceded by periods in which political and social movements employed such rhetoric. In Nazi Germany, Jews were described as vermin, and Nazi propaganda outlets claimed that Jews spread diseases. The recent ethnic cleansing of the Rohingya people of Myanmar was preceded by propaganda associating Rohingya men with rape.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/17/opinion/16powerNew/16powerNew-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 647, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/17/opinion/16powerNew/16powerNew-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 647}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/17/opinion/16powerNew/16powerNew-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 950, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/17/opinion/16powerNew/16powerNew-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1899, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/17/opinion/16powerNew/16powerNew-thumbSta