s.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/16/movies/john-wick-chapter-3-parabellum-review.html', 'snippet': 'The supercharged third installment of the hyper-violent franchise is staggeringly accomplished and wearyingly soulless.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In “John Wick: Chapter 3 — Parabellum,” guns have more dialogue than its hero and more capacity than seems technically possible, the spraying of bullets interrupted mainly to showcase another lethal weapon. Even more than its predecessors, this third installment in the reluctant-assassin franchise is, like most modern action movies, perfectly attuned to the needs of the foreign markets where most of its money will be made. Bangs and grunts and body slams do not require subtitles.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/17/arts/17johnwick-1/merlin_154674690_815ecb41-80b2-4a83-8a38-38d533d10e9c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 327, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/17/arts/17johnwick-1/merlin_154674690_815ecb41-80b2-4a83-8a38-38d533d10e9c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 327}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/17/arts/17johnwick-1/merlin_154674690_815ecb41-80b2-4a83-8a38-38d533d10e9c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 558, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/17/arts/17johnwick-1/merlin_154674690_815ecb41-80b2-4a83-8a38-38d533d10e9c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1115, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/17/arts/17johnwick-1/17john