1971- )', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Deception Cove (Book)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Laukkanen, Owen', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-05-16T16:44:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'BookReview', 'section_name': 'Books', 'subsection_name': 'Book Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By Marilyn Stasio', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Marilyn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stasio', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6e27f07f-f84d-5422-b1a0-ae185de9bcc7', 'word_count': 866, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6e27f07f-f84d-5422-b1a0-ae185de9bcc7'}, {'abstract': 'If he can’t distinguish himself in New York City, how does he expect to do it on the national stage?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/16/opinion/bill-de-blasio-president.html', 'snippet': 'If he can’t distinguish himself in New York City, how does he expect to do it on the national stage?', 'lead_paragraph': 'I started this column from the elliptical machine. And why not? If Bill de Blasio can run New York City from my gym — the Prospect Park Y.M.C.A., 11-plus miles and roughly 40 minutes from Gracie Mansion — then why can’t I work there, too?', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/16/opinion/16senior1web/merlin_154928085_88b20c46-aae4-4183-b616-c62b34fbbc6b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/16/opinion/16senior1web/merlin_154928085_88b20c46-aae4-4183-b616-c62b34fbbc6b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/16/opinion/16s