. In fact, for the spring 2019 men’s collections, a handful of designers reconsidered the staid rules of tailoring and are proposing updated — and more inventive — ideas for wearing blazers and slacks. Here, a guide to wearing a suit this season, along with easy styling tips that make use of items you may already own.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/08/t-magazine/08tmag-suiting-slide-ZWX1/08tmag-suiting-slide-ZWX1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/08/t-magazine/08tmag-suiting-slide-ZWX1/08tmag-suiting-slide-ZWX1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 480}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/08/t-magazine/08tmag-suiting-slide-ZWX1/08tmag-suiting-slide-ZWX1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/08/t-magazine/08tmag-suiting-slide-ZWX1/08tmag-suiting-slide-ZWX1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1638, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/08/t-magazine/08tmag-suiting-slide-ZWX1/08tmag-suiting-slide-ZWX1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/05/08/t-magazine/08tmag-suiting-slide-ZWX1/08tmag-suiting-slide-ZWX1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/08/t-magazine/08tmag-suiting-slide