', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was the second day of Alejandro González Iñárritu’s tenure as the jury president of the Cannes Film Festival, and the weather was perfect: Outside his hotel-room balcony on the Croisette, the sky was blue and the ocean was even bluer. Still, as Iñárritu spoke about the complicated future of the film industry, you’d be forgiven for expecting storm clouds.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/16/arts/16alejandro-inarritu-promo/merlin_154958697_6d2a4301-cac5-4885-af07-cc2aabb7b40a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 452, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/16/arts/16alejandro-inarritu-promo/merlin_154958697_6d2a4301-cac5-4885-af07-cc2aabb7b40a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 452}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/16/arts/16alejandro-inarritu-promo/merlin_154958697_6d2a4301-cac5-4885-af07-cc2aabb7b40a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 771, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/16/arts/16alejandro-inarritu-promo/merlin_154958697_6d2a4301-cac5-4885-af07-cc2aabb7b40a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1543, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/16/arts/16alejandro-inarritu-promo/16alejandro-inarritu-promo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/05/16/arts/16alejandro-inarritu-promo/16alejandro-inarritu-promo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'ca