.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/17/arts/dance/alexei-ratmansky-seasons-american-ballet-theater.html', 'snippet': 'Over 10 years, American Ballet Theater has become fluent in the style of Mr. Ratmansky, whose new work will be unveiled at the spring gala.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On a recent afternoon, the choreographer Alexei Ratmansky stood at the front of a large studio at American Ballet Theater, preparing to run through, “The Seasons,” his latest ballet for the company. He said a few final words to the dancers: “Remember, there is a mystery about the seasons, a divine energy. It’s more than pretty dances. There is an inescapable force that makes these things happen.”', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '37', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/19/arts/19RATMAN-SEASONS1/19RATMAN-SEASONS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/19/arts/19RATMAN-SEASONS1/19RATMAN-SEASONS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/19/arts/19RATMAN-SEASONS1/19RATMAN-SEASONS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/19/arts/19RATMAN-SEASONS1/19RATMAN-SEASONS1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/19/arts/19RATMAN-SEASONS1/19RATMAN-SEASONS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/05/19/arts/19RATMA