b8ca-9b2a96d077c8'}, {'abstract': 'What ‘electability’ seems to mean in 2020 — and what it meant in 2018.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/17/opinion/joe-biden-president.html', 'snippet': 'What ‘electability’ seems to mean in 2020 — and what it meant in 2018.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The most important requirement for the Democratic Party’s presidential nominee? Electability. It matters more, we keep hearing, than nominating a candidate who has good policies. It matters more than nominating a candidate with a track record of passing progressive legislation. It certainly matters more than nominating a candidate who could be the first female president.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/17/opinion/17filipovichWeb/merlin_154838349_54bb34b2-f9f0-4544-9b6d-797b00b7eacf-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/17/opinion/17filipovichWeb/merlin_154838349_54bb34b2-f9f0-4544-9b6d-797b00b7eacf-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/17/opinion/17filipovichWeb/merlin_154838349_54bb34b2-f9f0-4544-9b6d-797b00b7eacf-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/17/opinion/17filipovichWeb/merlin_154838349_54bb34b2-f9f0-4544-9b6d-797b00b7eacf-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/17/opinion/17filipovichWeb/17filipovichWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75,