 lost little of his support there.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/20/us/politics/trump-voters-job-layoffs.html', 'snippet': 'The recovery, which has brought low unemployment and rising wages elsewhere, hasn’t really lifted industrial northeast Ohio. But President Trump has lost little of his support there.', 'lead_paragraph': 'YOUNGSTOWN, Ohio — In May 2016, David Betras, a Democratic Party leader in the heart of industrial northeast Ohio, sent a memo warning Hillary Clinton’s campaign that it was on the verge of losing Ohio, Pennsylvania and Michigan because she was not connecting with blue-collar voters. These states “should be easy wins for us,’’ he wrote.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/19/us/politics/19ohio/merlin_154927599_e567e811-26be-4b44-8d7d-7b4493bfa763-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/19/us/politics/19ohio/merlin_154927599_e567e811-26be-4b44-8d7d-7b4493bfa763-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/19/us/politics/19ohio/merlin_154927599_e567e811-26be-4b44-8d7d-7b4493bfa763-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/19/us/politics/19ohio/merlin_154927599_e567e811-26be-4b44-8d7d-7b4493bfa763-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/19/us/politics/19ohio/19ohio-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subT