fc88e-c5c3-59f4-81c7-aa1893f19081'}, {'abstract': 'When I ran against an incumbent senator, I learned the hard way how well insiders stack primaries against challengers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/20/opinion/primary-challengers.html', 'snippet': 'When I ran against an incumbent senator, I learned the hard way how well insiders stack primaries against challengers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Senator Mike Enzi, Republican of Wyoming, announced his retirement this month after four terms in the Senate, he set off a wave of political speculation similar to what we might expect from the retirement of a Supreme Court justice. After all — they’re both lifetime appointments.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/20/opinion/20dodson-illo/merlin_155164566_108059e4-0cfa-4045-93cd-f2363c0a625f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 477, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/20/opinion/20dodson-illo/merlin_155164566_108059e4-0cfa-4045-93cd-f2363c0a625f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 477}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/20/opinion/20dodson-illo/merlin_155164566_108059e4-0cfa-4045-93cd-f2363c0a625f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 815, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/20/opinion/20dodson-illo/merlin_155164566_108059e4-0cfa-4045-93cd-f2363c0a625f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1629, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/20/opinion/20dodson-illo/merlin_155164566_108059e4-0cfa-4045