es, Blows Up Meeting With Pelosi and Schumer', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rebuking Pelosi,  Trump Condemns  ‘Phony’ Inquiries', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pelosi, Nancy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schumer, Charles E', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-05-22T16:03:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Baker, Katie Rogers and Emily Cochrane', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Baker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Katie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rogers', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}, {'firstname': 'Emily', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cochrane', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 3}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7e939228-eee3-5a78-b1cd-cddea958c257', 'word_count': 1642, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7e939228-eee3-5a78-b1cd-cddea958c257'}, {'abstract': 'In a scathing final report on the impact of budget cuts in Britain, an expert on extreme poverty compared the overhauls to the Victorian workhouse system.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/22/world/europe/un-poverty-uk-austerity.html', 'snippet': 'In a scathing final report on the impact of budget cuts in Britain, an expert on extreme poverty compared the overhauls to the Victorian workhouse system.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — A United Nations poverty expert warned on Wednesday that Britain’s social safety net has been badly damaged by the government’s austerity program and compared the country’s welfare overhauls to a version of a Victorian workhouse.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/22/world/22uk-poverty1/22uk-poverty1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/22/world/22uk-poverty1/22uk-poverty1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/22/world/22uk-poverty1/22uk-poverty1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/22/world/22uk-poverty1/22uk-poverty1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/22/world/22uk-poverty1/22uk-poverty1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/05/22/world/22uk-poverty1/22uk-poverty1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/22/world/22uk-poverty1/22uk-poverty1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'U.K. Austerity Has Inflicted ‘Great Misery,’ U.N. Official Says', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Austerity Program in Britain Has Inflicted ‘Great Misery,’ Says U.N. Poverty Expert', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Alston, Philip G', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Poverty', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Food Banks and Pantries', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Conservative Party (Great Britain)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-05-22T16:05:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ceylan Yeginsu', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ceylan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yeginsu', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/85544cdf-514e-5b16-85d9-28e6dd999893', 'word_count': 888, 'uri': 'nyt://article/85544cdf-514e-5b16-85d9-28e6dd999893'}, {'abstract': 'Speaker Nancy Pelosi is using rhetorical volleys, like accusing President Trump of “a cover-up,” to ease the pressure on impeachment as she counsels a methodical strategy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/22/us/politics/pelosi-trump-cover-up.html', 'snippet': 'Speaker Nancy Pelosi is using rhetorical volleys, like accusing President Trump of “a cover-up,” to ease the pressure on impeachment as she counsels a methodical strategy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Speaker Nancy Pelosi hopped into her SUV on Wednesday for the short drive to the White House knowing full well that a presidential ambush awaited. President Trump was not “serious,” and needed a way out of negotiations over a $2 trillion infrastructure plan that he could not pay for, she told lawmakers at the Capitol an hour earlier.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pelosi Pushes Go-Slow Strategy on Impeachment as She Goads Trump', 'kicker': 'News Analysis', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Pelosi Goads Trump  Even as She Eases Push for Impeachment', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pelosi, Nancy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Impeachment', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-05-22T16:09:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Glenn Thrush', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Glenn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Thrush', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News Analysis', '_id': 'nyt://article/a8d627f5-7bab-5237-bde4-6629bfe033d8', 'word_count': 1435, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a8d627f5-7bab-5237-bde4-6629bfe033d8'}, {'abstract': 'In an interview, Clarke discussed the emotional backstory for her character’s fate in the show’s final episodes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/22/arts/television/game-of-thrones-emilia-clarke-daenerys.html', 'snippet': 'In an interview, Clarke discussed the emotional backstory for her character’s fate in the show’s final episodes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Daenerys of the House Targaryen, the First of Her Name, Destroyer of the Realm — doesn’t quite