away with hand washing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/22/smarter-living/wirecutter/dry-cleaning-your-wool-sweaters-dont-bother.html', 'snippet': 'Clothing tags often say you need to dry clean wool and silk garments. But more often than not, you can get away with hand washing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There’s a unique thrill to beating the system. Scoffing at the “dry clean only” label on your delicate duds may not be the most exciting rebellion imaginable, but it’s a scheme that pays off on laundry day every week. It has for me: Instead of spending my money at the dry cleaners, I wash most of my silk and wool at home, right in the bathroom sink.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/06/14/smarter-living/00wc-dryclean/eb663daba0e646bbbfd54d9416a6eeb0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/06/14/smarter-living/00wc-dryclean/eb663daba0e646bbbfd54d9416a6eeb0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/06/14/smarter-living/00wc-dryclean/eb663daba0e646bbbfd54d9416a6eeb0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/06/14/smarter-living/00wc-dryclean/eb663daba0e646bbbfd54d9416a6eeb0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/06/14/smarter-living/00wc-dryclean/00wc-dryclean-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandar