ticle/658e558b-121c-55f3-a69b-0cd956f666eb'}, {'abstract': 'The Indian prime minister’s mix of Hindu nationalism and economic development helped him win re-election on Thursday. In his constituency, though, the mix cuts both ways.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/23/world/asia/election-results-india-narendra-modi.html', 'snippet': 'The Indian prime minister’s mix of Hindu nationalism and economic development helped him win re-election on Thursday. In his constituency, though, the mix cuts both ways.', 'lead_paragraph': 'VARANASI, India — It was 4 a.m. at the Yadav family home down a narrow lane in Varanasi, the constituency of the Indian prime minister, Narendra Modi. Vijay Yadav, 30, cut buns and toasted them one by one on a gas stove with the help of his mother, Kamla Devi.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/23/world/23modi-city1/merlin_155260857_082cb6f6-9ea5-4638-8aaf-b5cbbe3fa5e6-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/23/world/23modi-city1/merlin_155260857_082cb6f6-9ea5-4638-8aaf-b5cbbe3fa5e6-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/23/world/23modi-city1/merlin_155260857_082cb6f6-9ea5-4638-8aaf-b5cbbe3fa5e6-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/23/world/23modi-city1/merlin_155260857_082cb6f6-9ea5-4638-8aaf-b5cbbe3fa5e6-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'typ