 movies. That’s an error that “Booksmart” hopes to correct: this film, which opened Friday, stars Beanie Feldstein and Kaitlyn Dever as academically accomplished best friends, Molly and Amy, who hope to transcend their studious reputations one night as they hop from the rich kids’ boat party to the drama kids’ murder-mystery dinner to the cool kids’ blowout.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/29/arts/29booksmart-stars/merlin_155211243_4152265d-6587-4556-9a16-0a3bf2dca00a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 750, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/29/arts/29booksmart-stars/merlin_155211243_4152265d-6587-4556-9a16-0a3bf2dca00a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 750}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/29/arts/29booksmart-stars/merlin_155211243_4152265d-6587-4556-9a16-0a3bf2dca00a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 820, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/29/arts/29booksmart-stars/merlin_155211243_4152265d-6587-4556-9a16-0a3bf2dca00a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1639, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/29/arts/29booksmart-stars/29booksmart-stars-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/05/29/arts/29booksmart-stars/29booksmart-stars-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url'