will measure the strength of populists — and of supporters of the European Union.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/26/world/europe/european-parliament-elections-issues.html', 'snippet': 'More than 400 million Europeans are eligible to vote in an election that will measure the strength of populists — and of supporters of the European Union.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BRUSSELS — With more than 400 million Europeans across the 28 countries of the European Union entitled to vote in the European Parliament elections that end on Sunday, the poll is, next to India, the largest democratic exercise in the world.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/26/world/26eu-whattolookfor/0a11f354c3ce470e8a6fab4c5f132b98-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 373, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/26/world/26eu-whattolookfor/0a11f354c3ce470e8a6fab4c5f132b98-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 373}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/26/world/26eu-whattolookfor/0a11f354c3ce470e8a6fab4c5f132b98-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 637, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/26/world/26eu-whattolookfor/0a11f354c3ce470e8a6fab4c5f132b98-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1275, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/26/world/26eu-whattolookfor/26eu-whattolookfor-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/05/26/world/26eu-whattolookfor/26eu-whattolookfor-thumb