products but likes her cake, too.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Shailene Woodley, who has a full plate of projects, including the “Big Little Lies” Season 2 premiere on June 9 and two movies in the works, is as thoughtful with her beauty choices as she is with her career. Born in California, Ms. Woodley, 27, prefers her beauty products natural, meditates every single day and practices wellness rituals even in her hotel room. Find out what she’s into now.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/30/sports/28SKIN/merlin_154637604_05078d02-0b75-4cf0-b63b-bbfefe24b4c2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/30/sports/28SKIN/merlin_154637604_05078d02-0b75-4cf0-b63b-bbfefe24b4c2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 800}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/30/sports/28SKIN/merlin_154637604_05078d02-0b75-4cf0-b63b-bbfefe24b4c2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/30/sports/28SKIN/merlin_154637604_05078d02-0b75-4cf0-b63b-bbfefe24b4c2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1536, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/30/sports/28SKIN/28SKIN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/05/30/sports/28SKIN/28SKIN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/30/sports/28SKIN/28SKIN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Why Shailene Woodley Is Taking Ice Baths in Her Hotel Room', 'kicker': 'Skin Deep', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Bath Water Is Freezing. She Doesn’t Mind.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Woodley, Shailene', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cosmetics and Toiletries', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Skin', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deodorants', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hair', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Big Little Lies (TV Program)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-05-28T17:43:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bee Shapiro', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bee', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shapiro', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d1082a04-ac5b-5d7a-b022-ac4b08eed672', 'word_count': 1184, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d1082a04-ac5b-5d7a-b022-ac4b08eed672'}, {'abstract': 'Time Out Market New York, from the publishers of the magazine, features 21 vendors in a two-story space in Dumbo.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/28/dining/time-out-market-new-york.html', 'snippet': 'Time Out Market New York, from the publishers of the magazine, features 21 vendors in a two-story space in Dumbo.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The layout of the two-story Time Out Market New York, opening Friday, may be typical — aisles lined with vendors making and serving their specialties, areas for communal tables — but the details set it apart. Seats are leather. Your food comes on chinaware, with metal utensils. Drinks from three bars are poured into glasses, and there is staff to clear the tables. “We also offer a cultural aspect,” said Didier Souillat, the chief executive of what is now a group of three markets owned by the Time Out Group in London. “There’s a stage and an exhibition space.” It’s worth noting that the riverfront views, especially from outdoor tables and the upper floor, can’t be beat. The 21 participating food companies and restaurants, selected by the editors of Time Out New York, include Clinton Street Baking Company, Jacob’s Pickles, Breads Bakery, Felice Pasta Bar, Mr. Taka ramen, David Burke Tavern, Center Cut for kosher meat and vegetarian fare from the chef Ivy Stark at Bklyn Wild.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/29/dining/28burner3/merlin_155350170_b8d0f73a-ae28-4360-b0af-789c0ace63aa-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/29/dining/28burner3/merlin_155350170_b8d0f73a-ae28-4360-b0af-789c0ace63aa-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/29/dining/28burner3/merlin_155350170_b8d0f73a-ae28-4360-b0af-789c0ace63aa-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/29/dining/28burner3/merlin_155350170_b8d0f73a-ae28-4360-b0af-789c0ace63aa-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/29/dining/28burner3/28burner3-thumbStand