rganization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b9e8ccb4-1e22-52ac-8ec6-800359de2a53', 'word_count': 1216, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b9e8ccb4-1e22-52ac-8ec6-800359de2a53'}, {'abstract': 'Female animals were once deemed too hormonal and messy for science. Some scientists warn it’s not enough to just use more female lab rats.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/05/30/health/gender-stereotypes-research.html', 'snippet': 'Female animals were once deemed too hormonal and messy for science. Some scientists warn it’s not enough to just use more female lab rats.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Say you are prescribed medication for depression, anxiety or even just to sleep. Would you want to take it if you knew that the drug had only been tested on men and male animals?', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/30/science/30SEXBIAS/30SEXBIAS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/30/science/30SEXBIAS/30SEXBIAS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/30/science/30SEXBIAS/30SEXBIAS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/30/science/30SEXBIAS/30SEXBIAS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/30/science/30SEXBIAS/30SEXBIAS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 